start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {2dc [2ch 3dc]x3 2ch}@ring ss@top fo
R2: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@sp [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp]x3 ss@top fo
R3: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@corner [3dc@sp {3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner]x3 3dc@sp ss@top fo
R4: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@corner [3dc@sp 3dc@sp {3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner]x3 3dc@sp 3dc@sp ss@top fo # "repeat round 3 with an extra 3-dc group per side"
